@startuml authoritative_command_state
title Target-only Authoritative Command State
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql t_sessions.
' Architecture change: current name and existing domain entries replace generic command history.
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Help / Status / Skills" as Read
rectangle Name
rectangle "Model / Thinking / Compact" as Domain
database "Current Session state" as Session
database "Existing domain Entries" as Entries
Read --> Session : observe only
Name --> Session : current displayName and version
Domain --> Session : atomic state
Domain --> Entries : authoritative changes only
note bottom
No public commandId or generic command lifecycle.
No Name history sidecar.
Queries, same-value updates, and empty compaction append nothing.
end note
@enduml

